{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_synopsis", "source_sha256": "591a2e994b4639543df9d4b5c204bfcc8ba471dc28a1bacb25a60a084760bf34", "ja": "新曲のレコーディングに失敗し、珍しく\r\n落ち込む未来。静香と翼に励まされて元気を\r\n取り戻した未来は、先に公演で歌う事を\r\n決める。公演の中で、未来はファンから、\r\nレコーディングに向けての元気をもらう。", "zh": "未来在录制新歌的过程中遭遇挫折，\n罕见地陷入低潮。在静香与翼的鼓励下，\n未来成功振作，并决定先在公演上演唱新歌。\n在公演中，未来从粉丝身上\n获得了面对录音的活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62c37b844d8f1c1645e23174f0ef345ca7eaea616ef93fb452f6646d4ef8e779", "ja": "（未来の新曲レコーディングが始まった。\nコンディションは万全みたいだし、これなら……）", "zh": "（未来的新歌已经开始录音了。\n她的状态看来非常好，这样一来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "681504476410bdd8c64e1aa56be386b316d2f67cfb802da511723ab69b462897", "ja": "んんっ？　あ、あれ～……？\nなんか、うまく歌えない……？", "zh": "嗯嗯？奇、奇怪……？\n感觉没办法顺利唱出来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ef8c183c5ed286048ea31c163c167446025b63a6d6db66096d3f4658f7ff8d73", "ja": "（と思ったが、そう上手くはいかないみたいだな……）", "zh": "（原以为不成问题，但似乎不太顺遂呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "449d2987f1f6ad6028666ccf484699087d480a99f7413553b71529620ff5b644", "ja": "なんでだろう？　う～ん……。\nすみません、もう一回、お願いしますっ！", "zh": "究竟是为什么呢？嗯……\n不好意思，请再让我试一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6b5d177bda9a5d267401f2e1a4d9662b7229a64f6ba683a2b7951a8c34c9443e", "ja": "未来、お疲れさま。\n調子は……あんまり良くなさそうだな。", "zh": "未来，辛苦你了。\n状况……似乎不太好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "465d0c34d14318230d07f43ed73762c991b6abb4c6b353a9c6ea88fd775331f8", "ja": "{$P$}さぁ～ん。ううっ、\nディレクターさんに怒られちゃいました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～呜呜，\n我被音乐总监骂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "3fe720f6aa8487a38977e52bdd209c68d5ceca688b16a524d653f0dd4219b874", "ja": "自分でも、なんか違うな～って思うんです！\nでも、言われたようには歌えなくって……。", "zh": "就连我自己，都觉得好像有哪里不对！\n但我就是没办法照着建议唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1008_p", "source_sha256": "42701648471905f854a183f9771a8a54d2ccf520819d2eb65836e148a77485e9", "ja": "ふーむ、そうか……。", "zh": "嗯，这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "e807f5f6a4aa92b901a6cc9d96151e3d0c0d9302cf39a81db882536cbafffcfc", "ja": "静香ちゃんや翼より先に新しい歌をもらったのに、\n全然上手に歌えないなんて……。", "zh": "明明比小静和翼更早获得了新歌，\n我却完全没办法唱好它……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "54e09fe93bf4f1b73aa28e110af81ebaa9664de2f8e5398d4f6996a86bcfacdf", "ja": "私、全然ダメだ～……うう……。", "zh": "我真是太差劲了～呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a848c5fadfc78f1875cbe02bcde82332da865bb0acf5885efecfbe9298a09f36", "ja": "（未来、珍しくずいぶん落ち込んでるな……。\n自分の曲を上手に歌えないのが、堪えたのかな）", "zh": "（未来难得变得这么消沉呢……\n无法顺利唱出自己的歌这件事，给了她很大的冲击吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0e90750ab523b10b24dc60edb1885e832e9f95ad6f754c65a2e669b9d63cd673", "ja": "（いや、それとも……）", "zh": "（不，又或者是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1013_p", "source_sha256": "541832251eee0aa06dc2041bc4cf7ba331e3ddb9c1f3a036aa865f5d537fd193", "ja": "そうだな……。たとえばだけど、未来は、\nアイドルの一番の魅力ってなんだと思う？", "zh": "这个嘛……我只是打个比方，\n你认为偶像最大的魅力是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "b99c7fbd183113dac25e0cf9e1120c0f6d33a76c72e2ca243c1fac8e9285f567", "ja": "えっ？\nアイドルの、一番の魅力……ですか？", "zh": "咦？\n偶像最大的魅力吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "e6509f778d141c6db3b17dca2969f14f5b756bca6a0b3f4ead6b8c0a81d6358d", "ja": "歌が上手で……あっ、ダンスがカッコよくて！\nそれから、すっごくかわいくて！　……はっ！？", "zh": "唱歌好听……啊，还有跳舞很帅气！\n然后就是非常可爱……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "3531cd40d80a96cf675aa85c032a0c3f0d0d5e3272cc95d8bd0d862cd3d1ce9f", "ja": "大変です、{$P$}さん！\n私、どれもそんなにすごくないかも～！？", "zh": "糟糕了，{$P$}先生！\n我好像每一项都没有很厉害耶～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fed60af9ad89792f25b8fcb63de7885c86ce7981e3c0ad5c5e0708679d62d36d", "ja": "いや、そんな事ないぞ。\n未来だって、立派な劇場のアイドルなんだし。", "zh": "不，没那回事喔。\n你也是剧场出色的偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "0afc94ff1a1d8e3cc526218d5592d849dceb9c7bf7c69962abb40d27a589f38b", "ja": "だってだって～！　静香ちゃんは歌が上手だし、\n翼はダンスも上手だし！　なのに、私だけ……。", "zh": "可是可是～！小静她很会唱歌，\n而翼甚至还很会跳舞！但就只有我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6597642666ce5e08ecfec667db00f501ac333f0a242ddc0e9f7fbcd21a7d338", "ja": "いいとこ、あんまりない……かも……。", "zh": "好像没什么……优点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b388d17dc8139a81d4c4602a2a8dccc1606cf104f10ac807da84e8576aa405c0", "ja": "未来……。", "zh": "未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f90fdcbb79358cde30e42ab49e9faa87cd8fbe0c91b1789dc1c400bb3f5ddbd", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん……。\nちょっと……聞いても、いいですか……？", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生……\n我可以……问你一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "1c9eef7f4c2678bfc6b5c8d57032ef2747db4290742ef603a45595dd9fae4572", "ja": "最初……私と、初めて会ったとき……。どうして\n私のこと、オーディションに誘ってくれたんですか？", "zh": "一开始……初次遇到我的时候……\n你为什么会邀请我来甄选呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "570dec4f79a23cad10dbc3d0286c2c6cc00349a1bcee5aadad91d3b57fc96e66", "ja": "静香ちゃんや翼に比べたら、私、いいとこないのに。\n……どうして私のこと、合格にしてくれたんですか？", "zh": "跟小静和翼相比，我明明没什么优点。\n……为什么你会录取我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "d9c0223f1da4b37ebc471f428521f0895b065d266ddc88a16967b7070709fdf1", "ja": "私、アイドルなのに……全然、すごくない……。", "zh": "我明明是偶像……却一点都不厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d5a379310823a468b299051810337ae61d43045e34d9fdcddfe9377a10d6361e", "ja": "いや、俺は結構すごいと思ってるんだけど……。\n自分じゃ、そうは思えないか。", "zh": "不，我认为你很厉害……\n不过你自己似乎不这么认为呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1026_p", "source_sha256": "472f6e06f85486a1852aad755c26ad84144d15432148ad6a495ebc69b8921a71", "ja": "それじゃ、未来は今の自分のこと、\nどんなアイドルだと思う？", "zh": "那么你认为现在的自己，\n算是怎样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "8669e84deafb8d1c05130df11b24d16f9bcd4afcead95e9a3d50bbd5ad17f4ea", "ja": "今の私ですか……？　えっと、えっと。\n私は……元気なアイドル？　あとは……。", "zh": "现在的我吗……？\n呃、呃，我算是……有活力的偶像？还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "1dc365f7690e2ad5690cab3cfec131ebefdb042cb9820490d307fa5c7042feaf", "ja": "わぁっ、やっぱり思いつきません～！\n元気なだけじゃ、全然ダメなのに～！", "zh": "哇，果然完全想不出来～！\n明明空有活力完全不行啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f3dfed90bbd51192a0652d16d5bd7e0f6f876de7a6e2579a5f4c2fd7123fb6cb", "ja": "元気なだけ、なんかじゃないよ、未来。\n未来のすごいところは、元気なだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "并不是空有活力喔，未来。\n你厉害的地方，不只是充满活力这点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1030_p", "source_sha256": "93e511632a2246896fff2bbc715971d79325175aac2d639cf2d41c1ccf9d4f60", "ja": "不思議なくらい、元気をくれるところだと思う。", "zh": "我认为还有能给人多到难以置信的活力这点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "bf2667a729d038221060484f05034c1394aa1bfeb6eb572ada5b375ed0400005", "ja": "で、でも、元気って！\n……本当に、それだけでいいんですか？", "zh": "但、但是，一样是活力呀！\n……真的光是这样就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1032_p", "source_sha256": "223496356f6820016a366f5d3430e5550bb253fe4e7389ba96820969b36b9d42", "ja": "もちろん、本当にそれだけだと困るかな。\nでも、それはすごく大切で、すごい事なんだ。", "zh": "如果真的只有如此，的确会让人有点伤脑筋呢。\n不过，这可是非常重要、非常厉害的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6773003d830d34d532753e6be04e0fb9dcbaac248d2d7e1c1ab9547e4dbf410", "ja": "え～、そうかな～……。\n元気なアイドル……う～ん……。", "zh": "咦～是这样吗……\n有活力的偶像……嗯～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2a2a45d8ad7a56672f9fa6c7e88926899a56cb3c069fb9f8ebef329d7a8ce9c4", "ja": "……それで、そんな未来は、これからどんな\nアイドルになりたいって思ってるんだ？", "zh": "……那么你从今以后，\n想要成为怎样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ed01299c43959c87c148fe834ae02c1a1d083b9b880a8eeb849b90076544b91", "ja": "どんなアイドルに……？\nえ、えっと……えっと、えっと～！", "zh": "成为怎样的偶像……？\n呃、呃……呃、呃～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1036_p", "source_sha256": "e6f58a81256fb145e7571c731faafffee4337954f89cbf303da66d4228ed2bbd", "ja": "……焦らなくていいよ、宿題にしておこう。未来が\n納得できる答えが見つかるまで、考えてみてくれ。", "zh": "……不用着急也没关系喔，就把这当成作业吧。\n在你找到能接受的答案前，仔细思考看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e7faed111af0cbd09d67ceab572d974954544037db47f51c2b1bac5de2e5cb1", "ja": "はい、宿題……。\nうーん……。う～～～ん……？", "zh": "好的，当成作业……\n嗯……唔～～～嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a610b2cfaa6d9afc464cb8c9228e23d5eb5e5764852917b7b07b4390ed8396fd", "ja": "（結局、レコーディングは、いったん延期。\n今日のところは、解散となった）", "zh": "（结果录音暂时延期，\n今天就先解散了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1039_p", "source_sha256": "553ba1cb127d560ad68b06e40ec0fa2687d776c74ed6fdc69bdf55fbc55825f7", "ja": "（未来が未来らしくあるために、欠かせないもの……。\n自分でも、気がついてくれるといいんだけどな）", "zh": "（未来为了维持自我风格，不可或缺的东西……\n希望她自己也能察觉到呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "679317b18613bff8389efedc36a4e22a95082ad6a15276b26eba42573b0133f0", "ja": "あ、いたいた♪　未来～！", "zh": "啊，找到你了♪未来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "7099de37bb2359b8d93b625965068976b0d28ff4d8f4e8aabf6bb07b2bb2ced0", "ja": "あっ、翼！　静香ちゃんも……！\nこっちこっち～！", "zh": "啊，翼！还有小静也在……\n这边这边～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "b4567734971546924306420cecf391a4f34c9e11be1fff142cf4f4eeb0b82520", "ja": "もう、未来！　ちゃんとスマホ見なさいよ。\nどこにいるか書いてないから、探しちゃったじゃない。", "zh": "真是的，未来！记得看手机啦。\n因为你没说你在哪里，害我们找得很辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c1d43dbc3c17ffbc905019e26a4f1fc32590dcd1405921099da450be571d6a5", "ja": "ああっ、通知いっぱいきてた！？　ごめーん！\nでもよかった～、静香ちゃんと翼が来てくれて。", "zh": "啊啊，有好多通知！？对不起──！\n不过小静和翼你们肯来真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "9f55d88f1b094a9b1dacae7e6fefb6eef8e8603c7516afa6e4aaea9f60ee253e", "ja": "よかったって、そりゃあ来るわよ。\n呼ばれたんだもの。", "zh": "说什么太好了，我们当然会来啊，\n毕竟是你找我们嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e83f1b10ac55064025775fc2b3f88e2b9c892a5fd3ba0eca618572c1ce755242", "ja": "そうだよ～。未来が呼んだんだよ？\nヘンなの～。", "zh": "就是啊～明明是未来找我们来的不是吗？\n你真奇怪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1047_014mir", "source_sha256": "6bad98ca87da775ed3c967c2619a8a1642ed33e48228057d3812484edff22567", "ja": "そうなんだけど、レッスンで疲れてるかもって……\nだから、ムリかな～って思ったんだ。", "zh": "是那样没错啦，但我想你们可能因为训练很累了……\n所以或许没办法过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "de4814c0a494123c3d39382aed63851a680a8e46a9da8acd00b557ca301ec8f1", "ja": "それは、だって……ねぇ？", "zh": "这个嘛，因为……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1049_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf49bab9383621d0e355ba9b4e60a4905164ab09936febe4cee147a71ba1dacf", "ja": "うんっ。だよね～♪", "zh": "嗯，就是说呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "22d8d06327fc361e77d4e814e088f4a123253040e00825963f6680f3b17dd950", "ja": "だから……それを言うなら、逆っていうか。\n疲れてるから、未来に会いたくなるの。", "zh": "就是啊……真要讲的话，应该是正好相反。\n正因为很累，所以才会想见到未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "7149138283dc76aa79093d336e9c38e96c1e2f6b4123a7b14f543804804ddbb6", "ja": "えっ……。\nそ、そうなの？　静香ちゃん、それホントに？", "zh": "咦……\n是、是这样吗？小静，你是说真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1053_015siz", "source_sha256": "4eec48ca1a8098ba23f0a68d9cc99734a55ffd5b8d404cf1fbf2c1b9c9bbe8a2", "ja": "わ、私にだけ聞かないで！\nだから……そうよね？　翼。", "zh": "别、别只问我啦！\n所以说……对吧，翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1054_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5c691834ce6f51171dbc1d30b8aa2598df97229acaeaab5db6d29cb2a87147b3", "ja": "うん！　未来って、なんか面白いんだもん♪\n一緒にいると、すぐ笑っちゃうし～。", "zh": "嗯！因为未来感觉很有趣呀♪\n只要和你在一起，就会立刻露出笑容～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "382dff4d08026dba09ea40140fe669e82790f2ed0ff13755a8c811e0868fccde", "ja": "ええっ、なにそれ、ぜったい褒めてない～！\nひどいよ、翼～！", "zh": "咦咦，那什么意思啊，你绝对没在夸我吧～！\n好过分喔，翼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1056_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e47b6a33f90c0f50ed9eda63a585de2636b07fdae98b505db5716743b69822bf", "ja": "あはは！　ほら、笑っちゃった！\nやっぱり未来は面白いな～♪", "zh": "啊哈哈！看吧，被你逗笑了！\n未来果然很有趣呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1057_015siz", "source_sha256": "aac48d7d72377b09bc1eb58b3a00246f5ab1ca7b81fde4d857257d8f371e3a13", "ja": "そうね。くやしいけど、そんな未来だから、\nあの曲を貰えたのかも。", "zh": "就是啊，虽然很不甘心，\n不过或许正因为是这样的未来，才会拿到那首曲子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1058_014mir", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1059_015siz", "source_sha256": "67f4235c95dca59b8ad535861e5fb269bf2366870debd7137a585b79cdc61e86", "ja": "それより未来こそ、どうして私たちを呼んだの？\n何かあった？", "zh": "不说这个了，我才想问你为什么找我们过来？\n发生了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1060_014mir", "source_sha256": "9782b324fc54787ba87d7e3ab5b13122c475cede489f6f965f6ff77981c40f95", "ja": "どうしてって……レコーディングがね、\nうまくいかなかったんだ。私ダメだ～って思って……。", "zh": "理由吗……其实是因为这次的录音不太顺利，\n让我觉得自己好失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1061_014mir", "source_sha256": "728531a93893802a566675e0a99b7ce5cbfc7ca12f7dd7c14499015a68db9681", "ja": "それで、ふたりに会いたくなって……。\nふたりに会って……。あれ？", "zh": "然后就很想你们两个……\n想见你们，然后……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1062_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e3e85c697c77dc710bcdfed78f478fa0e7b6f75acc7e258aa82224c88308d1e", "ja": "わたしたちと会って、元気になりたくて？\nあはっ、な～んだ。未来も同じなんだね！", "zh": "想见我们，然后让自己打起精神吗？\n啊哈，什么嘛～未来也跟我们一样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1063_014mir", "source_sha256": "abecdcfbbb1976fbfa74e9960aa08bcaf44e4ceb5c0e320fbf526336630f050f", "ja": "そっか……そうなんだぁ。\n元気になれるのって、すごいことなんだ……！", "zh": "是吗……原来是这样。\n原来能让人打起精神，是一件很厉害的事啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1064_015siz", "source_sha256": "ddd3d9dfe2ccad97458c549a138b53cff77f6f1128742c6eab395276adb2cf67", "ja": "ど、どうしたのよ、急に……。\n{$P$}に、ヘンなこと言われたの？", "zh": "你、你怎突然这么说……\n{$P$}跟你说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1065_014mir", "source_sha256": "b4f598c5416fe4745fb1e14e775f9f0dce7bcce957f9a766c9e0c4a7d87dd928", "ja": "うん、{$P$}さんにね、\n元気になるのはすごいことだーって言われたの！", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}先生跟我说啊，\n能带给人活力是件很厉害的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1066_015siz", "source_sha256": "bef6e0135e16393782263df6cad991bec5fff709aa94b79b1d90a75cca02b42f", "ja": "{$P$}が……？\nそ、そうなんだ。未来にそんなこと……。", "zh": "{$P$}他……？\n这、这样啊，他对未来说了这种话啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1067_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a0df7a2d6e077484736d687d0c8550f0363bb6e03bed98b7a28313f314628a1", "ja": "あのね、私、ちょっと宿題とかも出されて、\nもうどうしよう～って思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "是这样的，我被交代了一个小作业，\n所以一直在烦恼该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1068_014mir", "source_sha256": "33c345eb4c5862f3db76345d40aed202bd0e87de16201372b36313f986af396d", "ja": "もう平気になっちゃった気がする♪\n静香ちゃん、翼、ありがとーっ！", "zh": "但我现在觉得已经没问题了♪\n小静、翼，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1069_015siz", "source_sha256": "9be1cd499747f0749800f0053d5120115f5a5c930aa27ed6cd8ea94567195d35", "ja": "べ、別になにもしてないわよ。でも……\n元気が出たなら、よかったかな。ふふっ。", "zh": "我、我们什么都没做。\n不过……既然你打起精神了，那就太好了，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_048_1070_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a510a91662cbdf6e2d75d7490a7342c882e118561a158fbebe20f09b4ff320ba", "ja": "ねえねえ、それより早く帰ろうよ～！\nわたし、アイス食べたいな～♪", "zh": "欸欸，别管这个了，我们赶快回去吧～！\n我好想吃冰淇淋喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
